      "heading": "Track as Pending: when someone else will do it (proposal)",
      "intro": "Design only: nothing is built until you review it. Some items in To confirm, and some to-dos you already added, are really someone else’s promise. Track as Pending moves the item to Pending (“from Aditya · promised in Testing sync · by Fri”) instead of adding it: from Add as… or the row’s menu in To confirm, and from Send to on an added to-do. Pending and its Nudge / Mark received are unchanged (Actions: whose items, Pending and Highlights).",
